ltitude (850 meters, or 2,840 feet) of the Interlagos circuit, the turbocharged Renaults of Jean-Pierre Jabouille and Ren\u00e9 Arnoux were dominant, running 1-2 for much of the race until Jabouille's turbo failed on lap 25.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":17},{"lap":25,"text":"Arnoux had gotten up to 2nd, and when Jabouille retired Arnoux took the lead over and kept it until the checkered flag.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":0},{"lap":40,"text":"Arnoux won by 21 seconds over Italian driver Elio de Angelis driving a Lotus 81.","q":true,"src":"Wikipedia","c":0}]}